  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. The item fixture emits Install and Start (under tasks:) as kind handler and the second play's Install as task. yaml_ansible.py:347-396 sets in_tasks/in_handlers while processing play pairs, and task items processed afterwards read kind='handler' if in_handlers. The same fixture's file node spans 1-1. MECHANISM: section membership taken from a mutable last-seen section flag (in_handlers), not the item's ancestor key. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-palot,WI-janon."  # 1cf9
